msgstr "Importar sistemas existentes en |morpheus| para su administración sin volver a aprovisionar"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst
msgid "CLI & Tooling"
msgstr "CLI y herramientas"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:63
msgid ""
"hvmcli: unified CLI tool for HVM host management including log viewing, "
"VM/node/storage/cluster status, network configuration, and health "
